# Copy to `.dev.vars` for local development (git-ignored). Every value is optional –
# all of them can also be configured in the Admin area of the running app.

# Skip the first-run password screen by defining the admin password here (production: `wrangler secret put ADMIN_PASSWORD`).
# ADMIN_PASSWORD=change-me-please

# Defaults for settings that the Admin area can override:
# APP_NAME=FlareQR Studio
# API_TOKEN=require-this-bearer-token-for-the-api
# CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://app.example.com
# MAX_RASTER_SIZE=4096
